    <sys:String x:Key="LOCLS_SizesHint">Drag the orange handle of a box to resize that element, or type the pixel values. Boxes are drawn smaller than the real size.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCLS_BackgroundHint">The game artwork behind the whole window. The preview shows the blur, the darkness and the side panels as you move the sliders.</sys:String>
